.TH NEO-PROMPT 1 "2026-11-24" "gnome-phone" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-prompt \- prompt editor for GNOME Phone's assistant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-prompt
.RI [ DOCUMENT ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Edits the long texts of the phone's assistant and shows the context her agent receives: one document per prompt,
its history and the difference from the shipped text. Neo Settings and Neo Contacts open a document through D-Bus
activation (de.yesman.NeoPrompt). The documents, labels and settings are the JSON files
.IR neo-prompt.json ,
.I neo-prompt-files.json
and
.I neo-prompt-ui.json
of Minerva's configuration layers.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-settings(1), minerva-config(1)
